  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Ranerius de Malavoltis, sanus mente et corpore, relinquo confraternitati Sanctae Crucis Senensis domum meam magnam sitam in platea Sancti Christophori cum horto et puteo, ut fratres eiusdem confraternitatis ibi conveniant ad orandum pro salute animae meae et omnium fidelium defunctorum.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc meam ultimam voluntatem venire temptaverit, iram Dei omnipotentis incurrat et solvat poenam librarum trecentarum denariorum senensium.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Salvus de Piccolominis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ugolinus de Salimbenis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ildebrandinus de Berardenga</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Guido de Cacciacontis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
  </text>
